{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-js","path":"/blog/2024-10-24-how-to-change-select-box-size-in-react-js/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"excerpt":"Hi Friends 👋, Welcome To aHoisting! To change select box size in react js, you can set  and  in  . It will change select box size in react js. Today, I am…","html":"<p>Hi Friends 👋,</p>\n<p>Welcome To aHoisting!</p>\n<p>To change select box size in react js, you can set <code class=\"language-text\">width: 200px;</code> and <code class=\"language-text\">height: 50px;</code> in  <code class=\"language-text\">.select-size</code>. It will change select box size in react js.</p>\n<p>Today, I am going to show you, how to change select box size in react js.</p>\n<p>Table of contents</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Install and create a new React app.</li>\n<li>Import react component.</li>\n<li>Create a Component.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Let’s start with the first step.</p>\n<h2>Step 1: Install and create a new React app.</h2>\n<p>First you have to install the React project. You should use <code class=\"language-text\">create-react-app</code> command to create a new React project.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\">npx create<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>react<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\ncd my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\nnpm start</code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 2: Import react component.</h2>\n<p>After installing, you have to import your React component.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"react\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token string\">'./App.css'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 3: Create a Component.</h2>\n<p>You can use <code class=\"language-text\">className=\"select-size\"</code> to change select box size in react js.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>select className<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"select-size\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>option value<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"1\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>Option <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>option<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>option value<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"2\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>Option <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>option<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>option value<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"3\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>Option <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>option<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>select<span class=\"token operator\">></span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>Change select box size example.</h2>\n<p>The below code is an example of a React. You have to import <code class=\"language-text\">'./App.css'</code> and set <code class=\"language-text\">width: 200px;</code> and <code class=\"language-text\">height: 50px;</code> in  <code class=\"language-text\">.select-size</code> to change select box size in react js.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">App.js</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"react\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token string\">'./App.css'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token function-variable function\">App</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>select className<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"select-size\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>option value<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"1\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>Option <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>option<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>option value<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"2\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>Option <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>option<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>option value<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"3\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>Option <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>option<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>select<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> App<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">App.css</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre class=\"language-css\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token selector\">.select-size</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">width</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 200px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">height</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 50px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> </code></pre></div>\n<p>In the above code example, I have used the <code class=\"language-text\">width: 200px;</code> and <code class=\"language-text\">height: 50px;</code> to change select box size in react js.</p>\n<p>Check the output of the above code.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 374px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/e62580a69b618ba887cebf2f9a75eda5/ad40e/select-box-size.webp\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 91.77215189873418%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/webp;base64,UklGRmAAAABXRUJQVlA4IFQAAACwAwCdASoUABIAPtFcpk0oJSOiMBgIAQAaCWUAUwADz7T308VqOADeZ874qn1dY0/EKCbEuS/fa1HO/9ngXvu3t1yNRn9blUbQwesFs6tqntjAAAA='); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"React, select, box, size\"\n        title=\"React, select, box, size\"\n        src=\"/static/e62580a69b618ba887cebf2f9a75eda5/ad40e/select-box-size.webp\"\n        srcset=\"/static/e62580a69b618ba887cebf2f9a75eda5/81b7c/select-box-size.webp 158w,\n/static/e62580a69b618ba887cebf2f9a75eda5/6ea66/select-box-size.webp 315w,\n/static/e62580a69b618ba887cebf2f9a75eda5/ad40e/select-box-size.webp 374w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 374px) 100vw, 374px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>All the best 👍</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"How to change select box size in react js?","tags":["React"],"date":"October 24, 2024","description":"Example of change select box size in react js with step by step tutorial - aHoisting","social_image":{"absolutePath":"/Users/mac/Documents/hoisting/ahoisting/static/media/template/reactjs.jpg"}}},"prev":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How to change selection color in react js?"},"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2024-10-24-how-to-change-selection-color-in-react-js/"}},"next":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How to change scrollbar color in React js?"},"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2024-10-22-how-to-change-scrollbar-color-in-react-js/"}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/blog/2024-10-24-how-to-change-select-box-size-in-react-js/","prevSlug":"/blog/2024-10-24-how-to-change-selection-color-in-react-js/","nextSlug":"/blog/2024-10-22-how-to-change-scrollbar-color-in-react-js/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2555585279","2714594843","3159585216"]}